WEBVTT

00:29.500 --> 00:31.610
Man, it's cold...

00:31.610 --> 00:35.440
I might catch a cold by the time 
we make it to the Io Federation.

00:42.250 --> 00:43.300
Achoo!

00:43.300 --> 00:45.480
Hey, cover your mouth!

00:57.330 --> 01:01.870
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

02:19.770 --> 02:22.200
Just as we get rid of the demons,

02:22.200 --> 02:24.700
now we're on an expedition 
to the Io Federation.

02:24.700 --> 02:27.570
There are requests for assistance 
coming from other countries.

02:27.570 --> 02:30.290
Jeanne-sama is our hope 
for humanity right now, you know.

02:30.930 --> 02:34.700
I hope the royal capital will be completely 
rebuilt by the time we get back.

02:34.700 --> 02:38.010
Here's hoping it's not attacked 
by demons again before it is.

02:39.640 --> 02:43.180
<i><i>It's been five days 
since she came, huh?</i></i>

02:57.790 --> 02:59.320
Rinne? What's wrong?

03:00.620 --> 03:02.200
I smell demons.

03:04.740 --> 03:06.200
The scent disappeared?

03:07.970 --> 03:09.630
No! It's a trap!

03:14.250 --> 03:15.630
A demon barrier?!

03:17.370 --> 03:22.630
So it's you. The human who 
defeated my dearest sister, Vanessa.

03:27.600 --> 03:28.890
Code Holder!

03:34.860 --> 03:36.440
I'm not going to let you touch Kai!

03:45.510 --> 03:46.910
What's your intention?

03:47.170 --> 03:50.370
I'm just here to greet you, human.

03:51.560 --> 03:54.000
I'm Hinemarill, a succubus.

03:54.680 --> 03:58.880
<i>This pressure I feel... 
Is it equal to that of Vanessa's?</i>

03:59.380 --> 04:02.480
I heard that my dearest sister was defeated...

04:02.480 --> 04:04.840
and by a human of all things, y'know?

04:05.340 --> 04:09.520
It seems like you defeated her 
through a series of miracles,

04:09.520 --> 04:14.620
but if all three of us were at the royal 
capital, you probably wouldn't have won.

04:14.620 --> 04:16.470
What are you here for?

04:16.470 --> 04:18.120
To take revenge for Vanessa?

04:19.640 --> 04:23.420
As if. I love my dearest sister,

04:23.420 --> 04:26.130
but while she's not here, I'm number one.

04:26.130 --> 04:27.570
I'm actually grateful you did it.

04:27.570 --> 04:28.780
While she's not here?

04:30.900 --> 04:33.210
Let's talk business, human.

04:34.370 --> 04:36.580
You realize, if the demons gathered together,

04:36.580 --> 04:39.040
we could reclaim the royal capital anytime?

04:40.580 --> 04:43.880
But we're purposely letting you 
have the royal capital.

04:43.880 --> 04:47.260
And that's that. 
Why don't we both take a break?

04:47.730 --> 04:51.130
If you clash with us any further,

04:51.130 --> 04:53.520
you'll be vulnerable to the 
other three races, is that it?

04:53.910 --> 04:55.390
You can have the royal capital.

04:55.390 --> 04:58.060
However, all other territories 
belong to the demons.

04:58.510 --> 05:00.520
Those are our terms of truce.

05:00.520 --> 05:01.940
It's a pretty good deal, right?

05:03.240 --> 05:06.070
I'll relay the message to the commander.

05:06.370 --> 05:08.210
Well, that's our deal,

05:08.210 --> 05:10.780
so why don't you, chaotic being, 
quit glaring at me?

05:11.400 --> 05:12.240
No.

05:13.750 --> 05:18.000
Oh, yeah. By the way, I encourage you 
to fight with the other three races.

05:18.580 --> 05:20.290
I'll be cheering you on.

05:20.290 --> 05:23.590
You're telling us to 
get rid of each other, huh?

05:23.970 --> 05:26.930
That's right. Well, do your best.

05:27.450 --> 05:29.510
If you manage to do it, 
I'll even give you a kiss.

05:29.510 --> 05:30.470
No thanks.

05:30.470 --> 05:32.470
You're no fun.

05:33.130 --> 05:37.200
Well, anyway. I'll take you by force some day.

05:43.050 --> 05:45.400
If you plan on heading towards 
the celestial grounds,

05:45.400 --> 05:47.660
be wary of the Lord of Heaven, Alfreya.

05:48.100 --> 05:50.420
He's been acting weird lately.

05:55.080 --> 05:58.030
Let's leave the royal capital 
to the reconstruction unit.

05:58.030 --> 06:02.370
Our job as the expedition unit is to 
cooperate with the Io Federation Rebel Army,

06:02.370 --> 06:04.540
and take down the celestials.

06:04.540 --> 06:05.550
You're right.

06:05.960 --> 06:12.760
The celestials are elves, dwarves, fairies, 
and angels. An alliance race, right?

06:13.100 --> 06:17.890
Yeah. They're more cowardly 
and cunning than humans.

06:17.890 --> 06:20.150
They create powerful 
magical items to use in battle.

06:20.730 --> 06:23.500
If humans consider the demons monsters,

06:23.500 --> 06:26.070
they consider celestials enhanced humans.

06:27.830 --> 06:31.820
<i>My fellow soldiers, soon we'll pass 
the halfway point of the highway.</i>

06:32.270 --> 06:34.990
There's a rest stop in two kilometers.

06:34.990 --> 06:37.460
It hasn't been maintained for many years,

06:37.460 --> 06:40.080
<i>but it should be enough for us to rest.</i>

06:40.080 --> 06:42.080
Man, finally.

06:42.080 --> 06:44.650
Hey. It's too soon to be 
letting your guard down.

06:44.650 --> 06:45.670
Oh, come on...

06:44.960 --> 06:45.670
Ash!

06:46.580 --> 06:47.490
Open the window!

06:47.490 --> 06:48.810
Wh-What's going on, Rinne-chan?

06:48.810 --> 06:50.130
Just do it! Quickly!

06:53.350 --> 06:54.720
Kai, above us!

06:54.720 --> 06:55.920
They're coming from the sky!

06:57.170 --> 06:58.230
A mythical beast?!

06:58.510 --> 06:59.560
What's going on?

07:00.010 --> 07:02.620
We're supposed to still be in demon territory!

07:02.620 --> 07:04.120
Attention, all vehicles!

07:04.120 --> 07:04.980
It's a dragon!

07:04.980 --> 07:06.280
Enemy at three o'clock and above!

07:06.280 --> 07:08.530
All vehicles, move forward at full speed!

07:27.710 --> 07:28.460
Fire!

07:46.790 --> 07:48.570
Kai! Fire!

07:49.410 --> 07:50.690
Bolt Bullet!

08:05.220 --> 08:06.830
All vehicles, full stop.

08:06.830 --> 08:09.950
Rescue the passengers from groups 29 and 30.

08:10.420 --> 08:11.530
Does it hurt?

08:11.530 --> 08:13.140
Are you all right?

08:13.140 --> 08:14.200
Are you doing okay?

08:14.200 --> 08:15.150
It's over there!

08:22.030 --> 08:26.820
I kind of feel bad using a big tent 
like this for just the two of us.

08:28.770 --> 08:33.050
You know, there's probably a tent 
for the female soldiers...

08:33.670 --> 08:34.740
Don't wanna.

08:35.040 --> 08:39.340
Yeah, I figured... You'd feel 
too anxious surrounded by humans.

08:40.940 --> 08:42.810
Kai, Jeannie is coming.

08:42.810 --> 08:45.250
It's Jeanne, all right? What?

08:47.110 --> 08:49.390
Good work, you two.

08:53.580 --> 08:54.550
What's up?

08:54.860 --> 08:55.600
Oh...

08:56.040 --> 08:58.460
I'm just not sure why you're here, Jeanne.

08:58.460 --> 09:01.240
This is a tent for the commanding officers.

09:01.240 --> 09:04.690
You guys are nominally here as 
my bodyguards, remember?

09:04.690 --> 09:06.380
So of course we're together.

09:06.380 --> 09:07.020
What?

09:07.370 --> 09:09.770
Kai. I'd like a word.

09:13.370 --> 09:15.910
I'll stand guard here for the whole night.

09:16.170 --> 09:18.260
You'll stand guard on the inside.

09:18.260 --> 09:19.250
Huh?

09:19.250 --> 09:21.090
If a woman like myself stays with Jeanne-sama,

09:21.090 --> 09:24.250
there's a chance that people might 
realize she's a woman as well.

09:24.250 --> 09:25.500
Well, I suppose.

09:26.410 --> 09:31.220
I'm certain you're aware that Jeanne-sama 
must remove her armor when going to sleep.

09:31.220 --> 09:32.920
Yeah, I figured.

09:32.920 --> 09:37.840
Meaning, Jeanne-sama 
will be in light attire in front of you.

09:40.450 --> 09:41.800
Don't get any funny ideas, got it?

09:41.800 --> 09:43.130
Of course not!

09:43.130 --> 09:44.490
I'm just making sure.

09:44.490 --> 09:46.200
Please take care of Jeanne-sama.

09:47.820 --> 09:50.290
Oh, right there...

09:50.290 --> 09:51.960
It's working.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.450
This feels good?

09:56.740 --> 10:00.720
Yeah, and I'll give you one later.

10:02.610 --> 10:05.230
Must be tough pretending to be a guy.

10:05.230 --> 10:06.490
Yeah, it is.

10:06.490 --> 10:09.710
If you ever have to pretend to be a girl, 
you'll understand how I feel.

10:11.810 --> 10:13.950
Hey, about what happened earlier today...

10:13.950 --> 10:17.720
I wasn't expecting to see a mystical 
beast enter the Urza Federation.

10:18.750 --> 10:24.350
They may have come to scout the area after 
hearing about the demon hero's defeat.

10:26.610 --> 10:30.010
We've prepared enough defenses 
back at the royal capital.

10:30.010 --> 10:34.110
Even if a mythical beast were to attack, 
they wouldn't be taken over so easily.

10:35.180 --> 10:37.530
Worrying about it will only tire us.

10:40.420 --> 10:44.370
Kai, there's one important 
thing I need to tell you.

10:44.370 --> 10:45.130
What is it?

10:45.760 --> 10:48.200
I toss and turn in my sleep.

10:48.660 --> 10:51.320
I'm very sorry if I kick you during the night.

11:15.820 --> 11:17.070
You all right?

11:18.090 --> 11:20.280
You are Jeanne-sama's bodyguard, after all.

11:20.280 --> 11:22.030
You can't exactly sleep through the night.

11:23.000 --> 11:25.410
Yeah, sure. Let's leave it at that.

11:25.680 --> 11:26.660
What's that?

11:29.360 --> 11:31.290
That's the great border wall.

11:32.310 --> 11:34.270
<i>We'll be crossing the border soon.</i>

11:34.270 --> 11:36.800
<i>Beyond that stone wall is the Io Federation.</i>

11:37.370 --> 11:41.590
Our destination is the 8th city, Cassiopeia, 
just outside the Io Federation capital.

11:42.350 --> 11:45.080
<i>That's where the Io Rebel Army 
headquarters is located.</i>

11:46.050 --> 11:49.020
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:49.100 --> 11:52.020
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

11:59.940 --> 12:03.450
If we see a celestial, 
it's crucial to strike first.

12:03.450 --> 12:06.450
It seems our guns are more effective 
against them than the demons.

12:06.980 --> 12:10.500
Saki, before you shoot, 
you should take a deep breath.

12:10.500 --> 12:15.020
Humans and celestials appear very similar, 
so there's a chance you might misfire.

12:16.350 --> 12:18.040
<i>All vehicles, stop here.</i>

12:33.930 --> 12:35.370
Hey, hey, Kai!

12:36.660 --> 12:38.480
These are sweet and delicious!

12:39.000 --> 12:40.980
Is it safe to eat them?

12:41.240 --> 12:44.290
Yeah, though my tongue 
tingles after I eat one.

12:44.290 --> 12:46.430
That's poison! I wouldn't eat them.

12:46.430 --> 12:51.700
But I've eaten them before. 
A long time ago in the elven forest.

12:51.700 --> 12:54.160
Are those from the elven forest?

12:54.700 --> 12:57.370
This is due to the celestial invasion.

12:57.370 --> 13:00.420
They buried the human city 
with the elven forest.

13:27.200 --> 13:29.280
That was some greeting.

13:29.280 --> 13:31.910
To think we'd receive such a welcome...

13:34.600 --> 13:36.860
Welcome to the Io Rebel Army.

13:37.290 --> 13:40.040
We welcome your arrival.

13:40.040 --> 13:42.790
I am the Urza Rebel Commander, Jeanne.

13:42.790 --> 13:45.080
We appreciate the warm welcome.

13:46.210 --> 13:48.930
I am an advisor here, Zefven Backenhain.

13:48.930 --> 13:52.310
I am honored to meet you, 
Knight of the Sacred Light.

13:52.630 --> 13:55.770
The news of your victory 
against the hero of the demons

13:56.210 --> 13:59.650
has brought great hope to us.

14:01.030 --> 14:02.610
It's been a while, Falin.

14:02.980 --> 14:03.710
Yes.

14:04.230 --> 14:08.940
To think I survived to reunite with you, 
who's walked the battlefields of the world.

14:08.940 --> 14:11.460
We've both lived long lives, haven't we?

14:11.460 --> 14:13.720
I have an excellent master,

14:13.720 --> 14:17.710
and I am not yet old enough 
to be told I've lived a long life.

14:17.710 --> 14:19.230
Glad to hear.

14:20.490 --> 14:22.120
Without further ado, advisor.

14:22.120 --> 14:25.340
I would like to speak 
with your commander, Dante.

14:25.340 --> 14:27.970
Of course. Right this way.

14:29.420 --> 14:34.180
Falin, how much do you know 
about our commander?

14:34.600 --> 14:36.830
Dante Gelf Alighieri.

14:37.240 --> 14:40.450
He is descended from the old 
royal family of the Io Federation,

14:40.450 --> 14:42.720
and refers to himself as an emperor.

14:42.720 --> 14:43.890
And?

14:43.890 --> 14:47.800
He is also very envious, 
very suspicious, and very obsessive.

14:48.190 --> 14:53.460
Given these aspects of his personality, 
I'd say he sees Jeanne-sama as a threat.

14:54.480 --> 14:56.730
That is precisely the case, Jeanne-sama.

14:58.190 --> 15:00.450
I kindly ask that you understand.

15:00.450 --> 15:05.280
If nothing else, we, the soldiers, 
greatly appreciate your assistance.

15:10.490 --> 15:12.800
I am the assistant commander, Qubirey.

15:14.330 --> 15:19.060
Anything that needs to be discussed 
with His Majesty will be done through me.

15:20.590 --> 15:21.700
What's wrong?

15:21.700 --> 15:24.000
Oh... it's nothing.

15:27.740 --> 15:28.740
This is...

15:40.790 --> 15:44.000
I am Jeanne E Anise, 
the commander of the Urza Rebel Army.

15:44.550 --> 15:46.510
You certainly took your sweet time.

15:46.510 --> 15:48.920
I heard you were scheduled 
to arrive here in the morning.

15:49.430 --> 15:51.550
Did you intend to keep me waiting?

15:51.920 --> 15:54.430
We were attacked by a dragon on the way here.

15:54.430 --> 15:57.800
It took us half a day to tend 
to the wounded and fix our vehicles.

15:57.800 --> 15:59.890
I don't care about your sad excuses.

15:59.890 --> 16:01.520
Why did you come to this country?

16:01.520 --> 16:03.230
What do you mean, "why"?

16:03.700 --> 16:07.310
It seems you've driven off the demons 
and retaken the royal capital.

16:07.310 --> 16:11.630
Now, you intend on taking further 
glory and stealing my Io Rebel Army?

16:12.650 --> 16:15.210
The reason why we've come 
to the Io Federation

16:15.210 --> 16:17.530
is because you've requested our assistance.

16:17.530 --> 16:20.250
That's something my subordinates 
decided without my consent.

16:20.250 --> 16:25.360
Still, I assume you do not wish 
to be ruled by the celestials.

16:25.360 --> 16:26.640
Of course not.

16:26.640 --> 16:29.670
Then it shouldn't 
matter who earns what glory.

16:34.290 --> 16:36.350
I would like to add one thing.

16:36.350 --> 16:38.140
This is advice for you, Commander.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.040
Advice?

16:40.040 --> 16:42.650
You dare offer advice to me, the emperor?

16:42.650 --> 16:46.050
After we defeat the celestials 
and take back the Io Federation,

16:46.050 --> 16:50.510
it is neither you nor I who will decide 
what honors are awarded.

16:50.820 --> 16:53.220
It is our subordinates 
and the people who will decide.

16:55.380 --> 16:59.040
If you want honors, 
behave in manner worthy of them.

16:59.450 --> 17:04.650
Act as a commander worthy of respect,
and the people will praise you.

17:10.740 --> 17:16.790
The elven forest, the dwarven village, 
the fairies' hideout, and the angels' court.

17:17.420 --> 17:20.680
To a human, all of these are 
considered uncharted territories.

17:20.680 --> 17:22.280
Unlike with the demons,

17:22.280 --> 17:25.470
we don't know where the hero 
of the celestials is located, huh?

17:25.470 --> 17:26.730
Why, you...

17:27.890 --> 17:29.440
I'll lead the search.

17:33.800 --> 17:37.650
Commander Dante, may I borrow 
the Io Rebel Army's elite soldiers?

17:37.650 --> 17:39.010
Such foolhardiness,

17:39.010 --> 17:41.310
for the general to go to 
the front line personally.

17:41.310 --> 17:42.350
You have it wrong.

17:42.350 --> 17:47.130
I'm only lending my life to those 
who are continuing to fight on this land.

17:47.130 --> 17:48.250
Wow.

17:48.700 --> 17:50.420
So this is a hero...

17:49.690 --> 17:50.420
It's Urza's...

17:50.420 --> 17:51.770
As expected...

17:50.950 --> 17:52.320
What an amazing person...

17:52.320 --> 17:53.630
Is he serious?

18:05.400 --> 18:07.980
Is this really edible?

18:07.980 --> 18:10.820
Yep! I've had it before!

18:11.170 --> 18:13.090
By the way, Kai, did you see her?

18:13.090 --> 18:15.280
The beautiful assistant commander?

18:15.280 --> 18:16.550
The assistant commander?

18:17.170 --> 18:18.750
I think her name was Qubirey or something...

18:18.750 --> 18:21.940
Yeah, yeah! She was there 
during the joint meeting!

18:21.940 --> 18:24.450
Seriously, she was beautiful.

18:24.450 --> 18:25.910
You're the worst.

18:26.450 --> 18:31.070
Kai, is Qubirey the woman 
who was standing next to that guy?

18:31.070 --> 18:34.920
Yeah. Surprising to see you 
interested in a human, Rinne.

18:42.780 --> 18:46.010
So this is the elven forest.

18:50.670 --> 18:56.230
Jeanne... I never thought he'd be a man 
so reckless and unaware of his position.

18:56.500 --> 19:01.790
A general should remain in the rear 
camp while commanding the army.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.250
That's right.

19:03.250 --> 19:07.420
To take the lead and carry out expeditions... 
what kind of commander is he?

19:07.420 --> 19:10.730
Our soldiers are simply being influenced 
by that knight's recklessness.

19:10.730 --> 19:13.420
There is no need for Your Majesty 
to worry about such trivial matters.

19:13.710 --> 19:19.510
Qubirey, it seems you are 
my only proper subordinate.

19:27.980 --> 19:29.560
Welcome back.

19:29.840 --> 19:32.410
It is because of you that 
we were able to return safely.

19:33.110 --> 19:34.090
We appreciate it.

19:34.910 --> 19:36.520
We'll create a map quickly.

19:37.060 --> 19:39.280
Tomorrow morning, 
we'll hold a strategy meeting.

19:39.280 --> 19:40.030
Yes, sir!

19:41.350 --> 19:43.490
You looked extremely worried.

19:43.810 --> 19:45.140
Most certainly.

19:45.140 --> 19:47.960
Even if it was to gain the trust 
of the Io rebel army,

19:47.960 --> 19:49.690
to go on an expedition without me...

19:50.140 --> 19:51.700
I'll need to lecture her later.

19:56.850 --> 19:58.830
Yesterday's expedition has allowed us

19:58.830 --> 20:02.730
to identify the elven patrol routes based 
on celestial footprints we found.

20:02.730 --> 20:04.340
Wow!

20:04.340 --> 20:07.310
We'll continue our exploration 
of celestial territory,

20:07.310 --> 20:08.930
and plan an invasion strategy.

20:09.480 --> 20:11.390
Everyone, I ask for your cooperation.

20:17.880 --> 20:19.390
Is the meeting over?

20:19.390 --> 20:22.350
Just when do we get to fight 
the angels and elves?

20:22.350 --> 20:24.050
After we've prepared.

20:24.050 --> 20:26.010
The celestials are cunning.

20:26.010 --> 20:28.830
If we carelessly step into 
their territory, we'll be routed.

20:31.550 --> 20:34.710
Our opponent is the Lord of Heaven, Alfreya.

20:34.710 --> 20:36.750
When that time comes, 
please fight alongside us.

20:39.970 --> 20:40.760
What's up?

20:42.180 --> 20:45.430
Well... I don't see that 
Qubirey human anywhere.

20:45.760 --> 20:48.640
Yeah, Commander Dante isn't here either.

20:48.640 --> 20:51.020
I bet he isn't interested 
in commanding the field.

20:53.410 --> 20:54.690
Those barbarians!

20:55.110 --> 20:57.690
Getting carried away by that youngster!

20:58.170 --> 20:59.260
Your Majesty.

20:59.960 --> 21:02.450
We simply need to achieve 
something greater than Jeanne.

21:02.450 --> 21:03.460
What?

21:04.470 --> 21:08.660
If successful, Your Majesty's position 
will once again be solidified.

21:14.100 --> 21:18.790
You're going to personally lead the soldiers 
into the elven forest, Your Majesty?

21:18.790 --> 21:23.300
That's right. We'll capture elves and 
angels as prisoners of war.

21:23.300 --> 21:25.010
How is that possible?!

21:25.930 --> 21:30.220
I already have a flying column 
exploring deep in the elven forest.

21:31.020 --> 21:34.220
This is the first I'm hearing of this.

21:34.220 --> 21:35.810
We'll leave immediately.

21:36.100 --> 21:38.590
Won't that raise issues

21:38.590 --> 21:41.080
in our coordination with the Urza Rebel Army?

21:39.820 --> 21:41.080
Zefven.

21:41.960 --> 21:43.870
Who rules this land?

21:44.740 --> 21:46.360
Understood.

21:46.770 --> 21:51.370
However, Your Majesty, please allow 
my subordinates and I to accompany you.

21:51.800 --> 21:52.870
I'll allow it.

21:53.260 --> 21:57.780
But I will not allow you to leak 
this operation to the Urza Rebel Army.

22:01.580 --> 22:02.720
Yes, sir...

22:08.770 --> 22:09.720
Rinne?

22:13.530 --> 22:16.890
Hey, Kai, there's another 
meeting coming up, right?

22:16.890 --> 22:18.560
Yeah. Why?

22:18.560 --> 22:21.610
Um... I'm not totally sure...

22:21.900 --> 22:24.860
And if I'm wrong, I might be 
causing you trouble, so...

22:25.270 --> 22:27.320
I don't mind. Tell me.

22:29.850 --> 22:32.250
That woman, Qubirey...

22:32.900 --> 22:34.540
I don't think she's human.

22:54.370 --> 22:56.060
Lord Alfreya...

22:56.500 --> 23:00.270
Are you, the chief of the celestials, 
going to betray us?

23:01.310 --> 23:04.120
This world belongs to the angels.

23:04.120 --> 23:06.900
The other inferior races are not needed...

23:06.900 --> 23:09.810
but neither are the elves, 
dwarves, or fairies.

23:09.810 --> 23:11.440
Have you gone mad?

23:11.440 --> 23:13.780
Those heartless words...

23:14.160 --> 23:16.370
You can't truly mean them!

23:17.970 --> 23:21.000
What is that monster?!

23:21.000 --> 23:23.250
You don't need to know.

23:26.230 --> 23:30.820
From this day forward, 
I sever my ties with you.

23:31.650 --> 23:33.120
Forever.

23:35.050 --> 23:40.010
<b>Episode 5
"To the East of the World"</b>
